            "icon": "🛒",
            "question_count": 6,
            "open_first": false,
            "q_1": "How do I place an order?",
            "a_1": "<p>Browse our products on the <a href=\"phasis-shop-mobile.html\">Shop page</a>, select your size or quantity, and click Add to Cart. Proceed to checkout to enter your shipping information and payment details. You'll receive an order confirmation email immediately after purchase.</p>",
            "q_2": "What payment methods do you accept?",
            "a_2": "<p>We accept all major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), Apple Pay, Google Pay, and PayPal. All payments are processed securely through Stripe. We never store your full card details.</p>",
            "q_3": "Can I modify or cancel my order?",
            "a_3": "<p>We process orders quickly — typically within 24 hours. Contact us at as soon as possible if you need to modify or cancel. Once an order has shipped, we cannot cancel it but our 30-day return policy applies.</p>",
            "q_4": "Do you offer a subscription?",
            "a_4": "<p>Not currently — all products are sold as one-time purchases. We currently offer one-time purchases. We also have a rewards program — visit <a href=\"https://www.phasisevo.com/pages/rewards\">phasisevo.com/pages/rewards </a>to join and start earning points on every order.</p>",
            "q_5": "Is there a discount for buying multiple products?",
            "a_5": "<p>Yes — the PHASIS Stack bundles all three products (Max Relief Jar, Electro+ 4oz, Perform+ 60 caps) for $162, saving $28 versus buying separately. Individual product multi-pack pricing is also available — see each product page for details.</p>",
            "q_6": "Do you have a loyalty or rewards program?",
            "a_6": "<p>Yes — powered by Smile.io, our rewards program lets you earn points on every purchase, referrals, and more. Visit <a href=\"https://www.phasisevo.com/pages/rewards\">phasisevo.com/pages/rewards </a>to join.</p>",
