            "a_1": "<p>Orders are processed within 1–3 business days. Standard shipping (free over $75) takes 3–7 business days. Expedited shipping (2–3 business days) is $12.99. Overnight shipping is $24.99 for orders placed before 12pm EST. You'll receive a tracking number via email once your order ships.</p>",
