        "text": "<p><strong>Are your products safe to use daily?<br/></strong>Yes. All products are designed for daily use when used as directed. Consult your healthcare provider if you have medical conditions or take medications.<br/><br/><strong>What makes PHASIS different?<br/></strong>Phasis goes beyond standard wellness formulas. We thoroughly vet every ingredient and every supplier we partner with, ensuring purity, potency, and transparency at every stage. Our formulas use advanced delivery systems such as liposomal and oil-soluble technologies to maximize absorption and real-world results. For all CBD-based products, we use only USDA organic hemp sourced from trusted U.S. farms. Every product is intentionally crafted to support a specific phase of health and performance.<br/><br/><strong>Where are your products made?<br/></strong>All products are formulated and manufactured in the United States in GMP-certified and FDA-registered facilities.<br/><br/><strong>Are your products third-party tested?<br/></strong>Yes. Every batch is tested for purity, potency, and safety.</p>",
